        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That was helpful, thanks! Can you give tips for discussing ADHD and accommodations with a boss without making it awkward?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can ADHD be managed?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "You can request accommodations by focusing on your needs rather than your diagnosis, and by highlighting how changes will help your productivity, which can make the conversation less awkward. How does German law protect employees with ADHD?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0044-40-11164:4": 0.07634769991659812,
            "clueweb22-en0033-18-04361:17": 0.07119699797449158,
            "clueweb22-en0044-40-11164:3": 0.07112302403120499,
            "clueweb22-en0026-09-15240:12": 0.06995228877119444
