      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Do you know of any groups or local resources here in Germany that support office workers dealing with ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to manage multiple tasks at work while having ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For office workers in Germany dealing with ADHD, there are several resources available. ADHS Deutschland e.V. is a prominent organization that provides information, support groups, and advocacy for adults with ADHD. They have local chapters (Ortsgruppen) in many cities, where you can connect with others facing similar challenges. Additionally, many cities have Selbsthilfegruppen (self-help groups) specifically for adults or working professionals with ADHD\u2014these can be found via local health offices or online directories. Therapists specializing in ADHD and workplace coaching are also available; you can ask your general practitioner or local mental health clinic for referrals. Online communities and podcasts, such as those discussed in German media, can also offer support and practical advice for managing ADHD at work [DOC-1][DOC-5]. Would you like help finding a local ADHD support group in your city?",
