      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting! Any apps or specific tools that help keep tasks organized for someone with ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to manage multiple tasks at work while having ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "Several apps and tools can help with task organization for individuals with ADHD. Popular options include Todoist, Trello, and Evernote for managing to-do lists, notes, and projects. Hive and Asana offer more comprehensive project management features. MindNode can aid visual organization through mind maps, while Clear Todos focuses on daily task management. For automating routines, apps like Wunderlist are useful. Beyond apps, traditional tools like bullet journals, paper diaries, or day planners, and methods like using Google Calendar for time blocking, are also highly effective.",
