        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m just curious about how ADHD can be managed, especially in a work setting. What are some approaches or strategies?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can ADHD be managed?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For managing ADHD in a work setting, consider strategies like working with an ADHD coach or undergoing cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT) to develop organizational and time-management skills. To minimize distractions, request a quiet workspace, use white noise, or route calls to voicemail. Break down large tasks into smaller, manageable parts and focus on one task at a time. For impulsivity or hyperactivity, practice self-talk, take regular breaks, or incorporate physical activity. Utilizing planners and setting deadlines can also be highly effective.",
