      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great, thanks! Any tips on dealing with sudden tiredness at work if you have ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to manage multiple tasks at work while having ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "To combat sudden tiredness at work with ADHD, consider taking a short power nap or cooling your head with a wet cloth. Get up and move frequently by taking intermittent breaks, walking, or doing light exercises. Hydrate by drinking plenty of water. Eating small, healthy meals and snacks throughout the day can also help maintain energy levels. Additionally, try deep breathing exercises, listening to upbeat music, or getting some fresh air to re-energize.",
