        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That \u201cpre-arranged signal\u201d idea is pretty smart! What about during meetings\u2014how can ADHD folks stay attentive and not drift off?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to stay attentive in meetings while having ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To stay attentive during meetings with ADHD, try taking notes to prevent restlessness and aid memory, or use a tape recorder to capture details. You can also engage in \"intentional fidgeting\" like note-taking. To avoid distractions, limit disruptive fidgeting, stay off your phone, avoid engaging with others, and maintain eye contact with the speaker.",
