      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m just looking for ideas on how ADHD can be managed at work. Any tips?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can ADHD be managed?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "To manage ADHD at work, consider these tips: minimize distractions by using a quiet space, white noise, or earphones. Break down large tasks into smaller, manageable steps and use time management tools like electronic reminders, planners, or techniques like Pomodoro. Avoid over-scheduling yourself. Take regular breaks, especially if you have a sedentary job, to move around or get fresh air. Use memory aids like notes or checklists. Regular exercise and sufficient sleep can also improve focus and overall well-being, impacting your work performance.",
