      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s better, thanks! Are there specific tools or software made for ADHD that might help in an office?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can ADHD be managed?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "For managing ADHD in an office, specific tools and software can be very helpful. Task management apps like Todoist, Trello, Asana, Evernote, Microsoft To-Do, and Wunderlist can help organize tasks and set reminders. For enhanced focus, consider distraction-blocking software such as FocusWriter or Cold Turkey Writer. Digital notepads like Remarkable 2, transcription apps like Otter.ai, and mind-mapping tools like MindNode can aid note-taking and visualization. Some planners, like Planner Pad or PowerPlanner, are even designed specifically for individuals with ADHD.",
