      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Are there also any physical items\u2014like things for your desk\u2014that can help manage ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can ADHD be managed?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For physical items to help manage ADHD at your desk, consider various fidget toys like stress balls, fidget cubes, infinity cubes, flippy chains, or sensory rings. Liquid motion bubblers can also provide a calming visual focus. To aid movement and focus, you might use an anti-fatigue balance board with a standing desk, a chair balance disk for active sitting, or under-desk pedal exercisers. Additionally, a mini diffuser with essential oils like lavender or lemon can help create a calming environment.",
