          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting, thanks. Do you know any helpful routines I could try when I feel overwhelmed at work?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to manage multiple tasks at work while having ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "To manage overwhelm at work with ADHD, consider these routines: Take frequent active breaks like short walks or stretches to re-center yourself (P4, P17, P18). Practice quick relaxation techniques such as deep breathing, a 5-minute meditation, or visualization (P1, P3, P18). Connect with a trusted colleague to unload, or write down your immediate plans to gain clarity (P1, P3, P14). You might also adjust your environment with calming scents or by ensuring your workspace is organized (P2, P4). Opt for soothing teas instead of too much caffeine (P6, P16).",
