        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I'm more interested in practical support and advocacy groups that can help with ADHD at work in Germany. Do you know any names or where to start searching for those?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to manage multiple tasks at work while having ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "I couldn't find specific practical support and advocacy groups for adults with ADHD in a work setting in Germany within the provided information. The passages mention the 'ADHD Guidelines Group of the Association of Medical Scientific Societies in Germany,' but its focus is on research and clinical care, not practical workplace support.\n\nWould you be interested in general strategies for finding such local resources, or information on broader international ADHD organizations that might have resources applicable to Germany?",
