        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Hi! I\u2019m curious about ways ADHD is managed, especially at work. Any ideas?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can ADHD be managed?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 4,
          "text": "To manage ADHD at work, consider minimizing distractions by using headphones or seeking a quiet office. Enhance organization by maintaining a clutter-free workspace, keeping notes, and using electronic reminders or planners. For time management, break large tasks into smaller parts, set deadlines, avoid over-scheduling, and take frequent breaks. Rewarding yourself for completing tasks and maintaining a consistent routine can also be beneficial.",
