      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting! Are there any specific apps that people with ADHD use for task management?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to manage multiple tasks at work while having ADHD?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "For task management, individuals with ADHD often use apps like Todoist, which helps organize your day and boost productivity. Other popular options include Remember The Milk for simplifying tasks, Evernote for notes and reminders, Trello for managing daily tasks, and Asana for creating to-do lists and collaboration. Due- Reminders and Timers can also help keep you on track with daily reminders, and Clear Todos is useful for organizing your day.",
