        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I'm actually looking for ways ADHD can be managed, especially in work settings. Can you share some methods or tips?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can ADHD be managed?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 4,
          "text": "To manage ADHD in a work setting, consider using organizational tools like apps or the Pomodoro Technique for time management. Minimize distractions by using headphones for white noise or requesting a quiet workspace. Break large tasks into smaller, manageable pieces to combat boredom and procrastination, and use electronic reminders for deadlines. Taking regular breaks and notes in meetings can help with hyperactivity. Additionally, develop effective filing systems and seek feedback to improve performance.",
